[10.4,"o","Choose how unstale reads new release notes (costs are estimates; this repo has 2 technologies):\r\n"]
[10.46,"o","  1) Jev labelling API (JEV_API_KEY) + Vercel AI Gateway (AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY): $0.028 per technology-year · this repo ≈ $0.055 a year, first sync ≈ $0.055 once [--inference jev+env:AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY]\r\n"]
[10.52,"o","  2) Vercel AI Gateway (AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY): $0.055 per technology-year · this repo ≈ $0.11 a year, first sync ≈ $0.11 once · slightly less complete: ≈ 93% of the best option's breaking-change flags; ≈ 2 more duplicate records per technology-year [--inference env:AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY]\r\n"]
[10.58,"o","  3) Anthropic (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY): $0.075 per technology-year · this repo ≈ $0.15 a year, first sync ≈ $0.15 once · somewhat less complete: ≈ 90% of the best option's changes (fewer from upgrade guides); ≈ 23 more duplicate records per technology-year [--inference env:ANTHROPIC_API_KEY]\r\n"]
[10.64,"o","  4) None: deterministic signals only; new change details need a key or Codex [--inference none]\r\n"]
[10.7,"o","Record the choice with `unstale setup --inference <value>`.\r\n"]
